{
  "name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "internal_name": "SystemArchitecture",
  "focus": "High-level component and trust-boundary flow across user-facing staking, the StakingModule, pluggable reward contracts implementing IPlugin, TEL and other ERC-20 tokens, and the FeeBuyback flow. Show user calls into staking; staking\u2019s plugin reads, claims, and stake-change notifications; reward funding from FeeBuyback through the SimplePlugin increaser interface; token transfers; administrative controls; and external wallet, aggregator, and token interfaces.",
